# windsurf-account-manager-simple
===
 A Windsurf multi-account management desktop application developed based on Tauri + Vue 3 + TypeScript. It is used to manage multiple Windsurf accounts and provide functions such as point reset, bill query, one-click account change, subscription payment, etc. .
